&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Elastic, the Search AI Company, enables everyone to find the answers they need in real time, using all their data, at scale — unleashing the potential of businesses and people. The Elastic Search AI Platform, used by more than 50% of the Fortune 500, brings together the precision of search and the intelligence of AI to enable everyone to accelerate the results that matter. By taking advantage of all structured and unstructured data — securing and protecting private information more effectively — Elastic’s complete, cloud-based solutions for search, security, and observability help organizations deliver on the promise of AI.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;6qqag-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;6qqag-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What is The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;6qqag-0-0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;avsf9&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;8r92q-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;8r92q-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;8r92q-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Elastic Security is looking for a Senior Product Manager to help build and grow Elastic XDR. Great detection-and-response products come from a clear read of how attacks unfold and where defenders lose time, and this role puts you close to both. You will own a core area of the XDR &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;popover-trigger-:r14:&quot; class=&quot;chakra-text css-cua023&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;8r92q-1-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;roadmap&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;8r92q-2-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt; end to end, from requirements through shipped, iterated product, and contribute to the exposure and vulnerability capabilities now converging with it.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;8r92q-0-0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;avsf9&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;refa-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;refa-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;refa-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;You will be the person an engineering lead respects for the quality of your requirements, and a credible product voice in front of security customers. You will work on a platform whose unified data model and deployment flexibility, from cloud to on-premises to fully air-gapped, , partnering closely with Engineering and the Elastic Security Labs research team. This is a role for a product manager ready to own meaningful surface area in a fast-moving space and grow toward broader ownership.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;30r30-0-0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;30r30-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;30r30-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-ul&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;afhse-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-reset public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;avsf9&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;afhse-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;afhse-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;afhse-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Own a core area of the XDR &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;popover-trigger-:r16:&quot; class=&quot;chakra-text css-cua023&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;afhse-1-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;roadmap&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;afhse-2-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt; end to end: drive detection, correlation, incident building, and response capabilities across endpoint, cloud, identity, and network, from requirements through shipped and iterated product.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;avsf9&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;cmf68-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;cmf68-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;cmf68-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Expand and maintain the telemetry and integrations XDR depends on: first-party Elastic data plus third-party EDR, cloud, identity, and network sources that let the product correlate across a real environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;avsf9&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;45i67-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;45i67-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;45i67-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Contribute to Elastic&#39;s exposure and vulnerability management work, including prioritization based on exploitability and reachability rather than raw CVSS, and remediation workflow.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;avsf9&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;c34v8-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;c34v8-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;c34v8-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Write requirements engineering can act on without follow-up clarification meetings, and translate customer input and threat research from Elastic Security Labs into product.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;avsf9&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;75sr2-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;75sr2-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;75sr2-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Represent product in customer conversations, including senior security stakeholders, and bring what you learn back into the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;popover-trigger-:r18:&quot; class=&quot;chakra-text css-cua023&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;75sr2-1-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;roadmap&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;75sr2-2-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;avsf9&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;e5lkp-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;e5lkp-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;e5lkp-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Ensure your capabilities work across Elastic&#39;s deployment models, from cloud to on-premises to air-gapped, so they hold up in regulated and disconnected environments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;avsf9&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;bdcng-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;bdcng-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;bdcng-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Maintain well-developed awareness of the competitive landscape and GTM strategies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;avsf9&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;6hev9-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;6hev9-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;6hev9-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Create artifacts such as &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;popover-trigger-:r1a:&quot; class=&quot;chakra-text css-cua023&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;6hev9-1-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;roadmap&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;6hev9-2-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt; trackers and decision memos that give stakeholders visibility without requiring a meeting.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;7vd4q-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;7vd4q-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;What You Bring&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-ul&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;4adb6-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-reset public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;avsf9&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;4adb6-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;4adb6-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;4adb6-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Experience: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;4adb6-0-1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;At least 5 years in security-related technical product management, competitive analysis, or technical marketing, and a minimum of 3 years in a related product development or technical field. A track record of owning product areas from requirements through shipped, iterated outcomes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;avsf9&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;38am5-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;38am5-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;38am5-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Detection and Response Domain Knowledge: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;38am5-0-1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Hands-on knowledge of XDR, EDR, SIEM, incident response, or forensic either as a product manager or as a practitioner such as a SOC analyst, detection engineer, or incident responder. You can discuss correlation, response, and detection engineering credibly. A practitioner background before transitioning into product is a solid plus.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;avsf9&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;a4m2h-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;a4m2h-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;a4m2h-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Telemetry and Integration Breadth: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;a4m2h-0-1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Comfort building or owning products that rely on heterogeneous third-party data, with a awareness that XDR depends on ingestion breadth and healthy integrations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;avsf9&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;aurnk-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;aurnk-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;aurnk-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Analytics and Threat Understanding: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;aurnk-0-1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;A solid comprehension of the analytics techniques behind detection and prioritization and of the current cyber threat landscape. Familiarity with AI security, how AI, ML, and agentic systems are attacked and defended, is a plus. Solid comprehension is required; hands-on modeling is not. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;avsf9&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;e4lq9-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;e4lq9-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;e4lq9-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Technical Credibility: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;e4lq9-0-1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;You earn respect from engineering through the quality of your requirements, and you know enough about architecture to judge feasibility and scope.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;avsf9&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;9m583-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;9m583-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;9m583-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Customer-Facing Confidence: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;9m583-0-1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;You are comfortable representing product to security customers, including senior stakeholders, and can hold both the practitioner and the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;popover-trigger-:r1c:&quot; class=&quot;chakra-text css-1j6t0d7&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;9m583-1-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;leadership&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;9m583-2-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt; view in the same conversation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;avsf9&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;dv4j7-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;dv4j7-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;dv4j7-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Communication Excellence: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;dv4j7-0-1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;You can distill complex detection engineering and exposure concepts into clear narratives for both technical and non-technical audiences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;avsf9&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;5jsdl-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;5jsdl-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;5jsdl-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Comfortable with AI-Augmented Work: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;5jsdl-0-1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;You use AI tooling for synthesis, research, and delivery as a regular part of your workflow, and you own the final outcomes regardless of how they were produced.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;avsf9&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;20ajb-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;20ajb-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;20ajb-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Cross-functional Collaboration: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;20ajb-0-1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;You have operated across Product, Engineering, Sales, and Customer Success, and you drive execution in a dynamic, remote-first environment with growing autonomy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;avsf9&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;52p2o-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;52p2o-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;52p2o-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Proficiency and Education:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;52p2o-0-1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt; A robust interest in cybersecurity and its challenges is essential. Attention to detail is important. You must also have the ability to understand the bigger picture. A BS or MS degree in engineering, computer science, or information security is required.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Compensation for this role is in the form of base salary.&amp;nbsp; This role does not have a variable compensation component.&amp;nbsp; The typical starting salary range for new hires in this role is listed below.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;These ranges represent the lowest to highest salary we reasonably and in good faith believe we would pay for this role at the time of this posting.&amp;nbsp; We may ultimately pay more or less than the posted range, and the ranges may be modified in the future.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;An employee&#39;s position within the salary range will be based on several factors including, but not limited to, relevant education, qualifications, certifications, experience, skills, geographic location, performance, and business or organizational needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Elastic believes that employees should have the opportunity to share in the value that we create together for our shareholders. Therefore, in addition to cash compensation, this role is currently eligible to participate in Elastic&#39;s stock program.&amp;nbsp; Our total rewards package also includes a company-matched Registered Retirement Savings Plan (RRSP) with dollar-for-dollar matching up to 6% of eligible earnings, along with a range of other benefits offered with a holistic emphasis on employee well-being.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The typical starting salary range for this role is:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$153,100&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$191,900 CAD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Additional Information - We Take Care of Our People&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a distributed company, diversity drives our identity. Whether you’re looking to launch a new career or grow an existing one, Elastic is the type of company where you can balance great work with great life. Your age is only a number. It doesn’t matter if you’re just out of college or your children are; we need you for what you can do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We strive to have parity of benefits across regions and while regulations differ from place to place, we believe taking care of our people is the right thing to do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive pay based on the work you do here and not your previous salary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health coverage for you and your family in many locations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to craft your calendar with flexible locations and schedules for many roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous number of vacation days each year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Increase your impact - We match up to $2000 (or local currency equivalent) for financial donations and service&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up to 40 hours each year to use toward volunteer projects you love&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embracing parenthood with minimum of 16 weeks of parental leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Different people approach problems differently. We need that. Elastic is an equal opportunity employer and is committed to creating an inclusive culture that celebrates different perspectives, experiences, and backgrounds. Qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, ethnicity, color, religion, sex, pregnancy, sexual orientation, gender perception or identity, national origin, age, marital status, protected veteran status, disability status, or any other basis protected by federal, state or local law, ordinance or regulation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We welcome individuals with disabilities and strive to create an accessible and inclusive experience for all individuals. To request an accommodation during the application or the recruiting process, please email &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:candidate_accessibility@elastic.co&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;candidate_accessibility@elastic.co&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;gmail_default&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;We will reply to your request within 24 business hours of submission.&lt;/p&gt;
